@startuml
title Green Rides System States

[*] --> Login

state "Login" as Login
Login : entry / To Action
Login : do / Log in to the system
Login : exit / Username and password entered

state "Journey Details" as JourneyDetails
JourneyDetails : entry / Display journey details
JourneyDetails : do / Show route, distance, and estimated time of arrival
JourneyDetails : exit / User can proceed with driving mode or other options

state "Driving Mode" as DrivingMode
DrivingMode : entry / Activate driving mode
DrivingMode : do / Enable navigation and tracking features
DrivingMode : exit / User can choose to eat or end journey

state "Eat" as Eat
Eat : entry / Select place to eat
Eat : do / View menu and place order if hungry
Eat : exit / User can continue driving or end journey

state "Accident" as Accident
Accident : entry / Inform authorities in case of an accident
Accident : do / Send notifications to relevant parties
Accident : exit / User can provide feedback or end journey

state "Feedback" as Feedback
Feedback : entry / Provide feedback upon completion of journey
Feedback : do / Collect user input and suggestions
Feedback : exit / Journey complete

Login --> JourneyDetails : [login success]

JourneyDetails --> DrivingMode : [user chooses driving mode]
JourneyDetails --> Eat : [user is hungry]
JourneyDetails --> Accident : [accident occurs during journey]

DrivingMode --> Eat : [user chooses to eat]
DrivingMode --> Feedback : [journey complete]

Eat --> DrivingMode : [user continues driving]
Eat --> Feedback : [journey complete]

Accident --> Feedback : [journey complete]
Feedback --> [*] : [journey complete]

@enduml
